# Plain-file distribution. The published artifacts are small (4.15 MiB and
# 17.2 MiB) and must be clone-able WITHOUT git-lfs, so no LFS filter is declared
# here. The Hub-side .gitattributes is preserved beside this file as
# .gitattributes.hf-original for provenance only.
*.pt binary
*.safetensors binary
*.onnx binary
*.json text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
